      "title": "Annual General Meeting - Save the Date",
      "content": "Dear Members,\n\nWe are pleased to announce that our Annual General Meeting will be held on **February 15th, 2025** at the Community Center.\n\n**Agenda:**\n- Financial Year Review\n- Board Elections\n- 2025 Strategic Plan\n- Open Forum\n\nPlease mark your calendars and confirm your attendance. Your participation is crucial for our community's governance.\n\nLight refreshments will be served.",
